ILPHOTX SHOP — SUPER ADMIN DASHBOARD
Tugiye gutegura neza Super Admin Dashboard na Sidebar Structure ya ILPHOTX SHOP, dukoresheje architecture ya:
- Next.js — Frontend na application routing.
- PostgreSQL — Main database.
- Prisma ORM — Database models na queries.
- Redis — Caching, sessions, rate limiting, queues na real-time support.
Intego ni ukugira Super Admin Dashboard isa n'iya professional e-commerce marketplace nka Amazon Seller Central cyangwa Alibaba Admin, ariko ikagira imiterere n'uburyo bwo gucunga ILPHOTX SHOP.

Super Admin agomba kuba afite ubushobozi bwo kugenzura buri gice cya system: Users, Merchants, Products, Orders, Payments, Finance, Security, Staff, Reports na Global Settings.
1. Dashboard layout






















12














Dashboard izaba igizwe n'ibice bitanu:
1. Top Navbar: Search, notifications, messages, profile, quick actions.
2. Main Sidebar: Navigation z'ingenzi.
3. Sub Sidebar: Submenus zijyanye na navigation wahisemo.
4. Main Content: Page iri gukorerwaho.
5. Context Panel: Filters, date range, quick statistics cyangwa details bitewe na page.
Uko page izaba iteye
