Uko izajya ikora:
- All Users: kureba abantu bose bari muri system.
- Super Administrators: gucunga Super Admin accounts.
- Administrators: kongeramo, guhindura no guhagarika Admin.
- Merchants: kubona accounts z'abacuruzi.
- Customers: kubona accounts z'abaguzi.
- Staff Members: kubona abakozi ba merchants.
- Pending Invitations: gukurikirana invitations zitarakirwa.
- Roles & Permissions: gucunga roles na permissions.
- Suspended Users: kubona abahagaritswe.
- Inactive Users: kubona abatarimo gukora.
- Deleted / Archived Users: kubona amakuru y'abahagaritswe cyangwa archived.
Table columns:

User ID, Full Name, Email, Phone, Role, Status, Registration Date, Last Login, Actions.

Actions: View, Edit, Change Role, Suspend, Activate, Require 2FA, Send Announcement, Reset Password, Archive.

Super Admin ni we wenyine ugomba kugira uburenganzira bwo guhindura global roles za users.

