Payment Proof Verification:

Super Admin cyangwa Admin ufite permission azajya afungura payment proof, agenzure:
1. Customer name.
2. Order number.
3. Amount paid.
4. Payment method.
5. Transaction reference.
6. Uploaded receipt.
7. Bank/gateway confirmation.
Hanyuma agire amahitamo ya Approve cyangwa Reject, ashyireho reason, maze system ibike uwakoze verification.

Bank Accounts: Ni ho Super Admin azajya ashyiraho konti zikoreshwa mu kwishyurana, akazishyiraho currency, account name, account number, bank name na status.

