Iyi page izajya igira table ikurikira:
Column	Icyo igaragaza
User	Uwakoresheje system
Role	Role ye
Action	Icyo yakoze
Module	Igice yakoreyemo
IP Address	IP yakoresheje
Device	Igikoresho
Date & Time	Igihe
Status	Success / Failed

Iyo Super Admin akanze audit record, azajya abona:
- User Details.
- Action Description.
- Old Values.
- New Values.
- IP Address.
- Browser.
- Device.
- Request ID.
- Timestamp.
- Related Record.
Icyitonderwa: Password, access tokens, secret keys n'amakuru y'ibanga ntibigomba kubikwa muri audit log. Audit log igomba kurindwa guhindurwa, kandi ibikorwa byo guhindura roles, kwemeza amafaranga no guhindura bank accounts bigire audit records zidasibika na Admin.
