Iyi ni navigation structure. Ntibisobanura ko buri submenu igomba kugira database table yayo; zimwe zizajya ziba views zitandukanye zikoresha tables zimwe.
4. Uko tuzayishyira muri Next.js
Kubera ko ukoresha Next.js, sinakugira inama yo gukora pages zose muri file imwe. Tuzakoresha App Router, layouts zitandukanye na reusable components.
