5. Uko PostgreSQL, Prisma na Redis bizakorana
Next.js App Router

Dashboard, layouts, pages, server components

Authentication & Authorization

Session validation, RBAC, permissions

PostgreSQL

Permanent records


Redis

Cache & queues



Prisma ikoreshwa na Next.js services mu gusoma no kwandika amakuru muri PostgreSQL.

PostgreSQL na Prisma
Tuzagira models z'ingenzi:
- User
- Role
- Permission
- UserRole
- RolePermission
- MerchantProfile
- Shop
- MerchantStaff
- StaffInvitation
- Product
- ProductImage
- Category
- Order
- OrderItem
- Payment
- PaymentProof
- BankAccount
- MerchantEarning
- Settlement
- Conversation
- Message
- Notification
- Announcement
- AuditLog
- SystemSetting
- UserSetting
- Review
- Refund
- Delivery.
Redis
Redis izakoreshwa mu:
1. Dashboard caching.
2. Rate limiting.
3. Session management.
4. Background jobs.
5. Scheduled product publishing.
6. Notification queues.
7. Temporary verification codes.
8. Frequently accessed categories.
Icy'ingenzi: Redis ntabwo izaba ari yo ibika amakuru y'ingenzi y'amafaranga cyangwa audit logs burundu. PostgreSQL ni yo izaba source of truth.
6. Uburyo bwo kurinda Super Admin
Kubera ko Super Admin ashobora guhindura buri kintu, tugomba kugira security ikomeye.
Security feature	Uko izakora
RBAC	Kugenzura roles na permissions
2FA	Kwemeza login mu byiciro bibiri
Session Management	Kugenzura devices zinjiye
Audit Logs	Kubika ibikorwa byose
Rate Limiting	Kurinda login abuse
IP Monitoring	Gukurikirana IP
Password Hashing	Kurinda passwords
Sensitive Action Confirmation	Kwemeza ibikorwa bikomeye
Backup	Kurinda amakuru
Approval Workflow	Kugenzura ibikorwa by'amafaranga

Global Settings, bank account changes, role changes na settlement approvals bizajya bisaba re-authentication cyangwa 2FA bitewe n'uburemere bw'igikorwa.

7. Umwanzuro: Structure tuzajya dukurikiza
ILPHOTX SHOP
SUPER ADMIN CONTROL CENTER

16
Main navigation groups

150+
Potential submenu pages and views



Technology
Next.js
Prisma
PostgreSQL
Redis

Architecture principles
- Multi-vendor architecture.
- Role-based access control.
- Modular navigation.
- Centralized system settings.
- Secure payment verification.
- Full audit trail.
- Scalable database and caching.

8. Icyo nakugira inama yo gukurikizaho
Ndasaba ko tutahita dutangira gukora pages 150 icyarimwe. Tubanze dukore Super Admin Dashboard Foundation neza, kuko ari yo izaba template y'ibindi bice byose.

Ibyo tuzabanza gukora ni:
1. Super Admin Layout.
2. Main Sidebar yuzuye.
3. Dynamic Sub-sidebar.
4. Top Navbar.
5. Dashboard Overview.
6. Navigation routing.
7. Responsive design.
8. Authentication na permission protection.
Nyuma y'ibyo tuzajya twubaka buri module ukwawo.

Icyemezo cy'ingenzi: Super Admin na Admin ntibagomba gusangira permissions imwe. Super Admin agira full system access; Admin akagira operational permissions yahawe, ariko ntahindure global settings cyangwa system ownership.

Iyi ni yo structure nakugira inama yo gufata nk'ishingiro rya ILPHOTX SHOP mbere yo gutangira gukora code.



